message: >-
  This repository publishes The Drift Layer. Cite the individual paper you
  used, not the repository. Each paper's page prints the SHA-256 of the PDF
  it serves.
title: The Drift Layer
abstract: >-
  A series on the life of a payment mandate: what a delegated instruction
  authorizes, what the record shows when a delegate closes outside it, and
  what a conformance definition would have to say to be operative.
type: dataset
